WEBVTT

00:19.970 --> 00:23.040
Oh! Morning, Mayor!

00:23.640 --> 00:26.790
Miss Satome, Mister Sessha, good morning!

00:32.440 --> 00:35.050
Is Laidy still in her room?

00:36.610 --> 00:39.220
Laidy, dear. It's morning!

00:44.000 --> 00:46.770
Good morning, Laidy...

00:46.770 --> 00:50.440
G'mornin', Satome...

00:52.050 --> 00:54.740
Iz still mornin' y'know?

00:55.700 --> 00:58.510
I gonna sleeps 'til noon.

00:58.510 --> 01:00.970
It seems she's still half-asleep.

01:00.970 --> 01:04.000
Laidy, this is the mayor's house, remember?

01:11.900 --> 01:13.460
Good morning.

01:13.990 --> 01:15.610
This lodging was quite pleasant.

01:15.610 --> 01:18.340
Laidy, your ribbons are upside down.

01:21.900 --> 01:22.850
Dariel...

01:23.670 --> 01:27.600
We have two objectives in this village.

01:27.930 --> 01:30.640
One of them is mythril weapons.

01:30.640 --> 01:32.520
I was hoping you would allow 
us to seem them right away.

01:33.360 --> 01:37.610
So, this will be the first time that 
the current Hero has seen mythril.

01:37.990 --> 01:39.870
I'll leave it to you, Mayor.

01:42.010 --> 01:43.040
Yes, sir!

01:57.300 --> 02:01.640
<b>Chillin'</b>

01:57.300 --> 02:01.640
<b>in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

03:13.000 --> 03:16.000
<b>Episode 7</b>

03:13.000 --> 03:16.000
<b>Dariel Uses That One Skill.</b>

03:23.160 --> 03:27.580
This is the only forge in the 
world that can process mythril.

03:33.740 --> 03:35.730
It is very impressive.

03:36.480 --> 03:38.980
Wow! It's all squishy and wiggly!

03:39.520 --> 03:42.990
Mythril is fundamentally 
different from other minerals.

03:43.480 --> 03:47.570
What makes it most unique is that it's 
incredibly permeable to Aura!

03:51.680 --> 03:52.370
Oh!

03:52.700 --> 03:53.790
Wow...

03:53.790 --> 03:55.880
All I'm doing is passing 
Aura through it, but...

03:56.230 --> 03:58.040
I've never felt like this before!

04:00.030 --> 04:00.880
I-I'll...

04:00.880 --> 04:03.170
May I ask for a turn as well?

04:04.470 --> 04:06.720
Oh... Oh!

04:06.720 --> 04:07.680
This is...

04:09.140 --> 04:13.180
D-Dariel, please hurry up and 
tell us about made-to-order items!

04:13.180 --> 04:14.600
Yes, that's right.

04:15.870 --> 04:16.860
Sakai-kun?

04:17.140 --> 04:19.610
You called for me, Owner?

04:20.010 --> 04:22.990
This is our number one smith.

04:22.990 --> 04:25.360
To have the opportunity to create 
a weapon for the great Hero...

04:26.370 --> 04:28.160
What prestigious work.

04:28.600 --> 04:30.120
The Hero is next to him.

04:30.880 --> 04:35.760
The late master pounded the 48 forms 
of treating ladies right into young Sakai here.

04:35.760 --> 04:37.130
Treating ladies right?

04:37.690 --> 04:39.040
If you'll pardon me.

04:39.040 --> 04:39.630
Wha—

04:39.630 --> 04:41.530
Everything's all right.

04:42.100 --> 04:43.820
You're such a good girl.

04:44.670 --> 04:48.390
Sakai can discern Aura types 
through holding a person's hands.

04:50.810 --> 04:52.930
I think that's quite enou—

04:52.930 --> 04:55.920
Everyone, we have a Slash here!

04:55.920 --> 04:58.060
Thank you for coming!

04:58.660 --> 05:00.440
He got it right?

05:03.090 --> 05:04.700
Then, on to the next thing.

05:05.050 --> 05:08.950
As I mentioned earlier, 
we have two objectives here.

05:09.310 --> 05:11.700
The first is mythril weapons.

05:09.310 --> 05:11.700
Sakai! My bow needs maintenance.

05:11.700 --> 05:12.700
Huh?

05:11.700 --> 05:12.700
The other is..

05:13.350 --> 05:14.910
our fourth member.

05:15.330 --> 05:17.680
We've been searching for one for a long time, but...

05:18.330 --> 05:20.420
If that's the case, then leave it to me!

05:25.200 --> 05:26.630
This is...

05:27.040 --> 05:31.140
The First Hero's Party 
Selection Tournament...

05:31.500 --> 05:33.280
is now open!

05:33.280 --> 05:34.890
Yeah!

05:35.350 --> 05:38.150
On this day, we give thanks for the good 
fortune which we have been witness to.

05:38.150 --> 05:42.400
Today, without fail, a champion 
shall be born from our village!

05:42.400 --> 05:44.820
This is the age when my 
big bro will be on top!

05:44.820 --> 05:46.820
May he return laden with honors!

05:46.820 --> 05:47.470
Yeah!

05:47.470 --> 05:50.130
Defeating the Demon King isn't a game.

05:50.130 --> 05:51.990
I'm so sorry.

05:51.990 --> 05:54.500
But it shows how much everyone 
wants to defeat His M—

05:54.500 --> 05:56.550
defeat the Demon King, doesn't it?

05:56.550 --> 05:57.840
Well, of course they do!

05:57.840 --> 05:59.200
If it's to defeat the Demon King,

05:59.200 --> 06:02.320
you can receive all kinds 
of help from Center Guild!

06:02.320 --> 06:03.590
I see.

06:03.890 --> 06:05.440
Well now, let's begin.

06:05.440 --> 06:09.840
The method of selection will be a
head-to-head battle pitting three against 26!

06:09.840 --> 06:11.020
Wh-What?

06:11.020 --> 06:11.970
What's that?

06:12.380 --> 06:13.220
A wooden sword?!

06:13.560 --> 06:14.720
A pot lid?!

06:15.040 --> 06:15.970
A burdock root?!

06:16.930 --> 06:18.480
They're your handicaps.

06:18.810 --> 06:19.600
Now, come.

06:35.360 --> 06:37.390
No one this time either, huh?

06:37.390 --> 06:39.080
Just as always.

06:50.500 --> 06:51.800
His power level is impressive.

06:52.480 --> 06:54.060
But his accuracy is...

07:09.270 --> 07:09.820
Sk—

07:22.180 --> 07:23.670
Laidy!

07:24.240 --> 07:26.880
Were you about to use what I think you were?

07:26.880 --> 07:29.140
When his Aura hit me...

07:29.140 --> 07:29.920
It was just reflex...

07:30.690 --> 07:31.860
Big Bro...

07:33.480 --> 07:36.810
I'm a failure as your sworn little brother.

07:38.410 --> 07:41.060
<i>The fact that he cries a lot hasn't changed,</i>

07:41.490 --> 07:44.020
<i>but in this last year, Gashita has truly...</i>

07:44.650 --> 07:46.020
<i>become strong.</i>

07:46.800 --> 07:51.240
You're Lux Village's pride, 
our strongest adventurer.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.740
Strongest?

07:53.670 --> 07:54.700
Him?

07:55.880 --> 07:57.190
Dariel...

07:57.190 --> 07:59.500
Let's have a bout, one-on-one.

08:00.090 --> 08:03.770
Oh, but I've already 
retired as an adventurer.

08:04.560 --> 08:05.740
You...

08:06.960 --> 08:09.690
possess a power greater 
than Gashita's. I can feel it.

08:11.010 --> 08:12.430
Is conflict...

08:15.350 --> 08:16.760
something you hate?

08:53.210 --> 08:54.350
Laidy...

08:55.040 --> 08:56.800
Sh-She's fighting for real.

09:00.230 --> 09:01.310
I knew it.

09:01.840 --> 09:03.310
You are strong, aren't you?

09:05.640 --> 09:06.310
In that case...

09:10.570 --> 09:11.820
how about this?

09:13.660 --> 09:15.200
<i>This technique...</i>

09:15.200 --> 09:17.400
<i>I've seen it so many times with my own eyes.</i>

09:20.280 --> 09:21.910
Sky Rend!

09:21.910 --> 09:23.420
<i>I will...</i>

09:23.910 --> 09:24.660
<i>neutralize it!</i>

09:38.360 --> 09:39.430
<i>He's strong!</i>

09:46.250 --> 09:47.440
Please!

09:48.080 --> 09:52.440
You are the final member 
we have been searching for.

09:52.440 --> 09:54.580
Please, I beg of you!

09:54.580 --> 09:55.950
I'm asking, too!

09:58.160 --> 09:59.030
I'm sorry.

09:59.030 --> 10:00.030
What?

10:00.310 --> 10:01.030
What?

10:01.340 --> 10:05.100
Um, I'm sorry. I have work, so...

10:06.660 --> 10:07.980
If you'll excuse me.

10:09.040 --> 10:12.040
<b>Chillin'
 in My 30s after Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</b>

10:15.740 --> 10:17.140
Welcome home!

10:17.140 --> 10:18.050
Hom'!

10:18.640 --> 10:21.350
Will you have dinner, or use the sauna?

10:21.350 --> 10:25.060
Oh, I'm fine. I'll give Gran his milk.

10:25.060 --> 10:27.560
No! No!

10:27.560 --> 10:30.710
He really won't drink from a bottle.

10:30.710 --> 10:33.580
Gran does love his Mama's breasts, after all.

10:44.420 --> 10:45.540
Dariel!

10:46.060 --> 10:47.790
Huh? Oh! Laidy!

10:47.790 --> 10:48.790
Can I help you?

10:48.790 --> 10:49.870
So, you really...

10:50.440 --> 10:52.760
won't join us, no matter what?

10:54.550 --> 10:55.880
I'm sorry.

10:56.740 --> 10:59.550
I want to watch my son grow up.

11:00.540 --> 11:02.510
The painting that's on that wall...

11:03.200 --> 11:06.030
It's a portrait that Gashita made for us.

11:06.030 --> 11:10.270
My wife and I are talking about getting a
new portrait made each year on our anniversary.

11:10.830 --> 11:13.860
That's why I can't go with you.

11:14.380 --> 11:15.370
What else...

11:15.980 --> 11:18.280
What is it that restrains you?

11:18.280 --> 11:19.810
What else?

11:19.810 --> 11:22.560
Mayor, let me hold Gran!

11:22.560 --> 11:23.930
Let's see.

11:23.930 --> 11:26.030
Repairing the fences around the fields...

11:26.450 --> 11:28.990
hunting down monsters on the highways...

11:28.990 --> 11:31.290
and I'm worried about my 
father-in-law's back.

11:32.100 --> 11:33.530
There are lots of other things too.

11:33.530 --> 11:37.400
You consider things like that to be more 
important than defeating the Demon King?

11:37.400 --> 11:40.050
Well, I don't know about that.

11:40.490 --> 11:42.550
But I'm all right with it.

11:43.410 --> 11:47.560
It's all I can do to take care of the 
things I can hold within these two arms.

11:49.840 --> 11:53.060
No. You can do so much more than this!

11:54.050 --> 11:55.460
Fight alongside us and—

11:55.460 --> 11:57.120
It's all right, Laidy.

11:57.120 --> 11:58.460
For now, let's just...

11:58.460 --> 12:00.350
I am not giving up on this!

12:11.620 --> 12:14.200
<i>...there is someone who wants you back.</i>

12:14.200 --> 12:14.750
<i>What?</i>

12:16.140 --> 12:17.790
<i>Lady Doroye.</i>

12:17.790 --> 12:19.740
<i>She's been looking for you this whole time.</i>

12:22.340 --> 12:23.800
<i>Lady Doroye...</i>

12:24.330 --> 12:25.530
What is it?

12:25.530 --> 12:27.050
Oh, um...

12:27.480 --> 12:31.520
Y-You didn't need to come all the way out here to help get materials.

12:31.820 --> 12:33.410
I-It isn't like that!

12:33.410 --> 12:35.900
I'm not here for your sake!

12:35.900 --> 12:38.520
It's so that I can see the 
faces of the people here.

12:38.520 --> 12:40.790
I'm always holed up inside the castle.

12:40.790 --> 12:43.650
I don't want to lose sight 
of the reason I fight.

12:43.650 --> 12:44.540
That's why.

12:45.600 --> 12:46.510
Dariel...

12:47.300 --> 12:49.180
Those children's smiles...

12:49.180 --> 12:51.420
Let's continue to protect 
them from the invaders.

12:54.210 --> 12:58.340
<i>I could never turn my sword 
against the Demon King's Army.</i>

13:01.530 --> 13:02.340
Husband...

13:03.300 --> 13:04.840
Shall we eat?

13:05.430 --> 13:06.170
Yes.

13:07.010 --> 13:08.060
Thank you.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.410
Laidy!

13:26.410 --> 13:29.010
Tailing people is fun, isn't it?

13:29.010 --> 13:30.780
This isn't a game.

13:35.200 --> 13:37.370
<i>Defeating the Demon King...</i>

13:37.670 --> 13:41.800
<i>There can't be anything 
more important than that!</i>

13:44.360 --> 13:46.080
Good morning, Mayor.

13:46.080 --> 13:46.890
Good morning.

13:49.750 --> 13:51.620
Thank you for patrolling.

13:52.170 --> 13:55.320
Mayor, our number one's mental 
state is shaky again.

13:55.930 --> 13:58.440
Huh? Is that the flirty smith?

13:58.440 --> 14:00.130
He's like a completely different person.

14:01.870 --> 14:04.150
Come on out, Sakai.

14:04.660 --> 14:08.700
There's no need for you to force yourself 
to be happy and excited, right?

14:09.680 --> 14:10.910
But...

14:11.260 --> 14:13.480
my master told me.

14:13.480 --> 14:17.380
He said that adventurers all 
entrust their lives to us.

14:17.380 --> 14:21.530
That's why we have to give it 
everything we've got, too.

14:21.530 --> 14:24.000
I see. That's a great thing to learn.

14:24.000 --> 14:27.140
I know! Shall we talk about Mister Smith?

14:27.140 --> 14:30.270
I'd love to hear old stories about my master!

14:30.270 --> 14:31.800
He's giving him counseling?

14:32.840 --> 14:35.310
Oh, I'm glad you're here, Mayor!

14:35.310 --> 14:38.280
Wow! This guild is all shiny and clean!

14:38.280 --> 14:39.510
Keep your voice down.

14:39.510 --> 14:40.760
Father!

14:40.760 --> 14:42.740
You've hurt your back!

14:42.740 --> 14:44.920
Shouldn't you leave that to others?

14:44.920 --> 14:46.020
Excuse me!

14:46.840 --> 14:48.820
Oh, it's all right!

14:48.820 --> 14:51.240
This is my castle, after all!

14:51.240 --> 14:53.280
Cleaning it is my—!

14:53.670 --> 14:56.250
Father! I'll do it!

14:57.120 --> 14:58.940
He's cleaning.

15:01.850 --> 15:03.390
Oh, Mayor!

15:03.390 --> 15:06.050
Thank you for fixing the 
fence for us the other day.

15:08.090 --> 15:11.550
Thank you so much for hunting 
down the monsters on the highway!

15:12.440 --> 15:13.060
Mayor!

15:13.060 --> 15:13.800
It's the mayor!

15:18.160 --> 15:20.310
The mayor is amazing, isn't he?

15:20.860 --> 15:23.100
He's being thanked by everyone.

15:25.270 --> 15:26.450
Husband!

15:27.430 --> 15:29.440
Malika? What is it?

15:29.440 --> 15:32.070
I was taking a walk with Gran,

15:32.700 --> 15:35.580
and I was thinking that you 
might be coming home soon.

15:36.110 --> 15:37.080
You are correct!

15:37.490 --> 15:38.560
Shall we head home?

15:38.560 --> 15:39.290
Yes.

15:40.940 --> 15:43.390
Wow! So many vegetables!

15:43.390 --> 15:45.620
Everyone gave me all kinds 
of things for some reason.

15:50.430 --> 15:51.880
Say, Laidy...

15:52.880 --> 15:55.060
The scale of the most important things...

15:55.060 --> 15:57.600
Maybe everyone decides that for themselves.

15:59.000 --> 16:01.100
After watching the mayor...

16:01.100 --> 16:05.900
the work he does around the village looked 
as important as the Hero's duty, right?

16:06.700 --> 16:08.320
That's because...

16:08.320 --> 16:11.100
Dariel believes it to be so.

16:25.040 --> 16:26.240
What could it be?

16:26.240 --> 16:28.090
What do you want to discuss, 
just the two of us?

16:28.450 --> 16:30.920
First, to begin with...

16:31.710 --> 16:35.050
You have the exact same 
ability as that person does.

16:35.050 --> 16:35.590
What?

16:36.100 --> 16:38.560
The skill you used to negate my Sky Rend.

16:40.060 --> 16:41.680
Where did you acquire it?

16:41.940 --> 16:46.800
Well, um... It was sort of by watching 
and imitating you, Laidy.

16:46.800 --> 16:48.940
And yet, it was different from mine.

16:49.290 --> 16:52.920
There are those who possess 
Aura throwing skills,

16:52.920 --> 16:54.700
but there is one among them...

16:55.970 --> 16:58.780
who possesses a Sky Rend that
is leagues above the rest.

16:59.380 --> 17:01.970
The previous Hero, Alantsil.

17:02.560 --> 17:05.280
His skill was such that one couldn't 
really call it a Sky Rend anymore,

17:05.280 --> 17:06.500
so it was reverently called...

17:06.750 --> 17:08.970
the Fearsome Emperor's Sky Rend.

17:10.720 --> 17:13.510
Dariel, the skill you used was exactly that.

17:13.840 --> 17:16.510
<i>I didn't realize it was 
such an impressive skill.</i>

17:17.380 --> 17:20.990
<i>After all, as soon as battle began,
 the previous Hero...</i>

17:20.990 --> 17:23.020
<i>He'd fire them off like it was nothing!</i>

17:23.520 --> 17:25.310
<i>I honestly thought it must be a minor skill.</i>

17:25.610 --> 17:27.290
I had no idea.

17:27.290 --> 17:29.600
You used it without knowing what it was?!

17:29.600 --> 17:30.820
Y-Yes.

17:31.170 --> 17:34.230
Wha... Y-You...

17:36.520 --> 17:37.860
Who are you, really?

17:38.160 --> 17:40.490
I thought you strong and smart,

17:40.490 --> 17:43.450
but then you don't know 
things that everyone knows!

17:44.890 --> 17:50.420
And yet, you're skilled enough to be 
able to read the Hero's swordwork!

17:50.850 --> 17:55.170
Those with Aura abilities 
must stand forward and fight!

17:56.180 --> 17:57.260
That's why...

17:58.450 --> 18:00.320
you must defend them at my side!

18:00.320 --> 18:02.400
Humanity! And your own village!

18:02.400 --> 18:03.430
Wait, please!

18:04.970 --> 18:06.730
The Demon King's Army fights

18:06.730 --> 18:09.390
to drive away the Hero who has 
come to kill the Demon King.

18:09.390 --> 18:10.690
It's a defensive fight.

18:11.080 --> 18:13.680
Which means that as long 
as the Hero doesn't attack,

18:13.680 --> 18:15.600
there won't be any fighting.

18:15.600 --> 18:17.950
If the Hero doesn't attack?

18:18.490 --> 18:19.730
No.

18:19.730 --> 18:21.720
It was the demons who turned him...

18:21.720 --> 18:23.700
who turned the previous Hero, Alantsil...

18:24.650 --> 18:26.480
into a merciless monster.

18:29.680 --> 18:30.920
Laidy...

18:30.920 --> 18:32.420
You've grown strong.

18:32.420 --> 18:35.300
No. Alantsil, 
I'm far from reaching your...

18:35.300 --> 18:37.650
Don't become like me.

18:37.650 --> 18:38.370
What?

18:39.250 --> 18:42.860
Back when I had only just become the Hero...

18:42.860 --> 18:45.830
my days were happy ones, 
spent with my wife and only son.

18:46.510 --> 18:47.390
However...

18:48.290 --> 18:50.600
One day, everything was laid to ruin.

18:52.880 --> 18:56.590
I put an end to the one who had raided us,
 Bezetan of the Four Generals,

18:56.590 --> 19:00.150
but my son... Not even his 
corpse returned to me.

19:00.730 --> 19:03.630
I am the only one who 
need ever feel this way.

19:04.210 --> 19:08.740
So that no one else will 
ever have to feel as I do,

19:08.740 --> 19:09.920
please, fight on.

19:12.240 --> 19:14.670
That's right. It was entrusted to me.

19:15.000 --> 19:19.800
And that is why I want you 
to lend me your strength!

19:19.800 --> 19:24.430
I once fought demon soldiers 
at the Mythril Mine.

19:25.170 --> 19:29.060
They hesitated to kill non-combatants.

19:29.060 --> 19:31.470
In order to regain the 
trust of the demi-humans,

19:31.470 --> 19:33.660
they once sent a whole demon corps.

19:35.360 --> 19:37.120
Everyone is the same.

19:37.120 --> 19:38.690
They want to protect their friends, that's all.

19:39.430 --> 19:41.450
I don't want anyone to do battle.

19:42.190 --> 19:44.950
Because I have family on both sides!

19:50.000 --> 19:52.460
Dariel, you are far too kind.

19:52.930 --> 19:55.880
You are someone who must 
not be drawn into battle.

19:58.250 --> 20:00.810
I thought the things I lacked right now...

20:00.810 --> 20:03.810
were weapons and a fourth party member.

20:05.480 --> 20:06.390
However...

20:07.860 --> 20:11.890
what I truly need is a 
heart as strong as yours.

20:12.480 --> 20:13.900
To that purpose...

20:15.880 --> 20:21.490
I-I appoint you... as my teacher.

20:21.490 --> 20:22.490
I'm sorry?

20:22.800 --> 20:25.070
As far as I am aware,

20:25.070 --> 20:28.600
other than the previous Hero, 
there is no one stronger than you.

20:29.480 --> 20:32.160
So, please train me further!

20:33.740 --> 20:35.370
<i>Train her?</i>

20:35.370 --> 20:36.750
<i>The Hero?</i>

20:37.280 --> 20:41.010
<i>That act would be entirely too 
disloyal to the Demon King's Army.</i>

20:41.880 --> 20:45.640
<i>However, by keeping her where 
I can keep an eye on her,</i>

20:45.640 --> 20:49.620
<i>I may be able to stop the fighting,
 if only temporarily.</i>

20:49.620 --> 20:51.180
<i>And that's not all!</i>

20:51.180 --> 20:53.600
<i>Prolonged interaction with the Hero...</i>

20:53.600 --> 20:57.460
<i>might lead to an opportunity 
to stop this long war.</i>

20:58.500 --> 20:59.400
All right.

20:59.760 --> 21:02.540
If there is anything I can do, I will help.

21:05.950 --> 21:06.910
Good.

21:09.250 --> 21:10.570
Let's head back.

21:10.570 --> 21:11.320
Yes.

21:18.430 --> 21:19.420
Dariel...

21:19.860 --> 21:21.840
No matter where I look, I can't find him.

21:22.380 --> 21:24.590
There's no need to be so dispirited.

21:24.590 --> 21:28.090
Bashbarza has suddenly gone off somewhere.

21:28.490 --> 21:30.510
And Zebiantes doesn't come around anymore.

21:30.840 --> 21:34.520
She said something like, "I have to 
go look for something," didn't she?

21:35.190 --> 21:39.020
And I'd wanted to ask her to use 
wind magic to look for Dariel.

21:49.740 --> 21:51.350
H-Hey...

21:51.350 --> 21:55.200
Since the transaction finished quickly, 
I came here, as asked, but...

21:55.730 --> 21:57.290
We've been waiting for you.

21:57.690 --> 21:59.150
Come in! Come in!

21:59.150 --> 22:00.780
Thank you for having me.

22:01.880 --> 22:03.300
Wow.

22:04.100 --> 22:08.630
In addition to the mythril, 
I've found another treasure.

23:41.640 --> 23:45.650
Next time on <i>Chillin' in My 30s After 
Getting Fired from the Demon King's Army</i>,

23:46.520 --> 23:48.410
"Dariel Tends to Many Matters."

23:46.520 --> 23:51.070
<b>Episode 8</b>

23:46.520 --> 23:51.070
<b>Dariel Tends to Many Matters.</b>
